// BRIGHT FILL. The single global ITR_BRIGHT_SCENE_* block above (now ITR_BRIGHT_REALM_FILL_DEFAULT,
// below) was tuned so lost-world's DARK jungle-shadow albedo (floorColor #3d4a2e/wallColor #2a3320,
