// HEIGHT FRACTION (ITR_ROOM_SHELL_PARAPET_FRAC, retired — grepped: no other reader) — the wall is now a
// real capped-stem VOLUME, so "cut" means hide the segment's own UPPER mesh outright (a boolean), never
